+- Display code: one uppercase letter (prefix) followed by at least 3 digits, e.g. `N001`, `P002`, `E001`, … The prefix comes from the ticket's priority (see [Priority](#priority)). Numbering is per queue **and per prefix**, and **restarts at `001` every day** (`issue_date`). Unique per `(queue_id, code, issue_date)`. Tickets issued before this rule keep their legacy `A…` codes; those do not count toward the `N` (or any other) sequence.
 
